/001-story-lead.stdout.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.status.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.progress.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/progress/005-verify.progress.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/progress/003-implementor.progress.jsonl\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stderr.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/progress/005-verify.status.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/progress/003-implementor.status.json\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/streams/005-verify.stdout.log\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/04-turn-derivation/streams/005-verify.stderr.log\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
